      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Qwen Image 2.1 Background Removal — 25 steps\n\nStrict non-commercial use: research or evaluation only. Read the Qwen Research License: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE\n\nSetup defaults: INT8 diffusion and encoder, native Qwen 2.1 BF16 VAE. WebP output (Save as WebP Conditional). Select models in the setup wizard.\n\nSupply an edit target in Prompt Studio. The encoder latent controls output size and preserves reference aspect ratio. Encoder resolution stays at 1056 to avoid the grainy-output issue observed at 1024 (ComfyUI #16435). Keep the Turbo shift resolution in sync."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Qwen Image 2.1 Background Removal — 25 steps\n\nStrict non-commercial use: research or evaluation only. Read the Qwen Research License: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/LICENSE\n\nSetup defaults: INT8 diffusion and encoder, native Qwen 2.1 BF16 VAE. WebP output (Save as WebP Conditional). Select models in the setup wizard.\n\nSupply an edit target in Prompt Studio. The encoder latent controls output size and preserves reference aspect ratio. Encoder resolution stays at 1056 to avoid the grainy-output issue observed at 1024 (ComfyUI #16435). Keep the Turbo shift resolution in sync."
      },
